  "notes": "{九|きゅう} + {百|ひゃく}. Both parts keep their normal shape.\n\nPRONUNCIATION:\nAlways きゅうひゃく, never くひゃく. The く reading of {九|きゅう} survives only in fixed words such as {九月|くがつ} (September) and {九時|くじ} (nine o'clock).\n\nSOUND CHANGES IN THE HUNDREDS:\nOnly {三百|さんびゃく}, {六百|ろっぴゃく}, and {八百|はっぴゃく} change; {九百|きゅうひゃく} and the rest are regular.",
